    "topic": {
      "post_stream": {
        "posts": [
          {
            "id": 599376,
            "name": "Osmium Codes",
            "username": "osmiumc",
            "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/o/f6c823/{size}.png",
            "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:03:57.222Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hey n8n builders! <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/waving_hand.png?v=15\" title=\":waving_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":waving_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>we’re  <strong>Osmium</strong>, a newly launched marketplace for reusable software capabilities, AI systems, APIs, and automation tools.</p>\n<p>We’re inviting <strong>20 independent developers and automation creators</strong> to join our founding vendor cohort.</p>\n<p><strong>Who we’re looking for:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>n8n builders with original, reusable automation solutions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>AI agent and workflow developers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>API and backend integration creators</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Independent developers with working software they’d like to monetize</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What we’re offering:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>An additional channel to sell your existing work</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Freedom to set your own prices</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ownership of your original software</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Personal onboarding assistance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Opportunities to showcase available testing evidence</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is an <strong>independent vendor opportunity, not salaried employment</strong>. Earnings depend on actual sales, and we cannot guarantee customers.</p>\n<p>If you’ve built something reusable, we’d love to explore bringing it to Osmium.</p>\n<p><strong>Interested? Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:heythere@osmiumcodes.com\">heythere@osmiumcodes.com</a></p>\n<p><strong>Subject:</strong> Osmium Founding Vendor</p>\n<p>Tell us what you’ve built and share a demo or portfolio if available.</p>\n<p>Looking forward to meeting some brilliant builders!</p>",
